NewGoblin patch 0002 on gosh-sh/bee-engine v6.0.0 (015bc466613e7b7c41f272dc16ba0cacbf0e4d93), applied after 0001.
Premine mode: the next session is mined while one is delivered, held, then released or discarded from JS (bee_miner/src/wasm only).
Hunk-by-hunk explanation: 0002-newgoblin-premine.md. Design: docs/superpowers/specs/2026-10-31-pipelined-sessions-design.md §1.
License: AGPL-3.0-only (same as upstream).

